  lines:
  - speaker: You
    text: Where's the bloody knife? Is it still in the same place I found last time?
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 035e10dcc6ffb4506b2d69f521460b1b, type: 3}
  - speaker: Vivian Rose
    text: No one dares to move it except the head chef, so yeah... Still in the same
      place.
